    - "\u2713 Installed"
    - Dependencies
    - Runiverse OS Core
    - User-friendly game engine library for Unity Engine
    - 'This is the core package.

      All RuniOS packages require this package.

      

      It
      contains several utilities and a built-in resource management system.'
    - Runiverse OS UI
    - RuniOS's official runtime UI/UX system
    - 'The design is inspired by the game osu!lazer.

      

      It''s the heaviest
      and most complex app, requiring all of RuniOS''s packages as dependencies...

      However,
